# FCC-mas skill set — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env (next to this file) and fill in your own values.
# install.sh prompts for OPENAI_API_KEY interactively and writes .env for you.

# OpenAI API key — required for:
#   • fcc-dictation / fcc-verbal-cleanup / fcc-speech-ppt 的音檔 STT (gpt-4o-transcribe)
#   • fcc-speech-ppt 的 DALL-E 圖片生成
#
# Get one at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys (each user maintains their own).
# Optional if you never use audio input or speech_ppt.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
